{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#card-zh","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 是面向 DSH Web 的会话氛围灯插件：它读取当前及其他会话的运行与待处理状态，在屏幕边缘显示不同颜色的柔光晕，也可切换为旋转光带或静态渐变。插件将浮层接入 shell.overlay，在输入框下方提供常驻状态条，并在设置面板中提供启用开关、宽度、不透明度、效果、颜色、闪动和过渡等调节。顶部胶囊可汇总多个会话并跳转到代表会话，快捷键可切换氛围灯。适合希望不遮挡工作界面、快速辨认 agent 正在运行、已完成或等待审批、计划确认及回答的 DSH Web 用户。设置保存在浏览器 localStorage；不需要 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594-640","client.js:819-900","client.js:1033-1076","client.js:1113-1325","client.js:1327-1435"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#card-en","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mood-light adds a mood light to DSH Web, coloring the screen edge for running, completed, and pending session states. A capsule summarizes sessions and can open one; a composer bar and settings page offer controls. Settings are stored in localStorage; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594-640","client.js:819-900","client.js:1033-1076","client.js:1113-1325","client.js:1327-1435"]}
