{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#feature-1","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 的功能「会话状态氛围光」：根据会话运行、完成或待处理状态，在屏幕边缘显示对应颜色的光晕。状态自动更新，多会话时按优先级显示最高状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594-640","client.js:819-867"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#feature-2","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 的功能「多会话状态胶囊」：将鼠标移到屏幕顶部触发带即可查看聚合状态和其他会话数量；点击胶囊可跳转到代表该状态的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:867-900","client.js:1339-1354"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#feature-3","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 的功能「输入框状态条」：在输入框下方显示聚合后的状态和会话标题，并提供按钮关闭氛围灯。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1033-1076"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#feature-4","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 的功能「外观设置」：从 DSH 设置面板调整启用状态、光圈宽度、不透明度、渐变样式、状态颜色、闪动和过渡，并可恢复默认值。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1113-1325"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#feature-5","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 的功能「快捷键开关」：注册 mood-light.toggle 快捷键，在支持的平台和页面区域按下绑定键即可切换氛围灯。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1388-1435"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-moon-light#caveat-1","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-moon-light","commit":"28b756bac7fb996e279507372a37db99040e684f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood-light 将用户的外观配置写入浏览器 localStorage，并优先读取已保存配置；重置或更改设置会更新该本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:157-215"]}
